      "narrative": "Solinftec is a Series B robotics and manufacturing company that has raised $40M to date. The valuation analysis draws from a comparison universe of 9 private peers and 1 public comparable, all operating in the robotics and manufacturing sector at similar development stages. Primary private comparables include Generalist AI, Bedrock Robotics, and Dexterity, alongside peers such as Divergent and Exotec.\n\nTwo triangulation methods were applied. Stage-progression analysis, using the $40M total raised as a proxy for current value and applying a 1.9x step-up multiplier typical of Series B-to-next-stage progression, implies a valuation of $76M. Peer-median analysis across the three core same-sector, same-stage comparables yields a median valuation of $1.8B, with a range spanning $1.6B to $2.0B. The disparity between these methods reflects the wide variation in robotics company valuations at this stage.\n\nThe triangulated analysis supports a valuation range of $65M to $2.0B, with a median of $913M. The 30x spread between low and high estimates reflects material uncertainty regarding which peer set most appropriately anchors Solinftec's positioning. Resolution hinges on clarifying the company's revenue trajectory, total addressable market penetration, and technology differentiation relative to the peer set, particularly against the higher-valued Generalist AI and Bedrock Robotics.",
