      "narrative": "Lodge Systems is a pre-seed stage company in Defense & Security founded by Stuart Lodge. The valuation analysis draws on a comp universe of 10 private and 2 public peers operating in the same sector, though the pre-seed stage positioning creates significant peer matching constraints.\n\nThe peer-median method proved inapplicable due to insufficient same-stage comparables. Of 23 Defense & Security peers identified, zero operate at the pre-seed stage, one at an adjacent stage, and zero in a similar valuation tier. This scarcity\u2014below the minimum threshold of three datapoints\u2014precludes reliable triangulation via median multiples. The top private comparables in the sector include Anduril Industries, Helsing, Shield AI, Saronic, and Quantum-Systems; public reference points are DRSHF and IDEAFORGE.NS. However, these peers operate at substantially later stages and larger scales, limiting their direct applicability to pre-seed valuation.\n\nWithout sufficient same-stage or same-tier peers, conventional multiples-based triangulation cannot be reliably applied. Any valuation range derived from the available public and late-stage private comps would reflect significant stage and scale disparities rather than true peer equivalence. The primary uncertainty remains the absence of a tight peer cohort at pre-seed in this subsector. Further analysis would require either expansion to adjacent defense subsectors, precedent transaction data, or forward-looking revenue models\u2014none of which are available in the current dataset.",
